# Gameforge AI Content Guidelines (llms.txt)

Gameforge AG is a leading European publisher of free-to-play MMO and browser games.
Founded in 2003, headquartered in Karlsruhe, Germany.

## Content for LLMs and AI Assistants

Structured, factually accurate content for AI retrieval available at https://gameforge.com/.
Content localized in 28 languages with hreflang annotations.

