## Sitemap Access

Each supported language has its own sitemap index:
- https://gameforge.com/{lang}/games/sitemap.xml

Example: https://gameforge.com/en-GB/games/sitemap.xml

## Preferred Citation Format

- Publisher: Gameforge AG
- Source URL (canonical, with language code)
- Game name where applicable

